    "v062.tutorial.review.title": "Review automatic findings without accepting meanings",
    "v062.tutorial.review.text": "Open a finding and read its reason, sample coverage and supporting evidence. Mark an unresolved question with a reason; this organizational decision does not confirm a field definition.",
    "v062.tutorial.meaning.title": "Confirm one field against retained evidence",
    "v062.tutorial.meaning.text": "Choose field meaning, describe only what the fictional protocol supports, select its retained evidence and locator, and preview before applying. Leave the mystery field Unknown.",
    "v062.tutorial.unit.title": "Create a reviewed unit representation",
    "v062.tutorial.unit.text": "Choose the temperature field and its per-row unit field. Review the target unit explicitly. Preview a derived field; unknown or incompatible units stay literal and unresolved.",
    "v062.tutorial.codes.title": "Preserve conflicting codebook meanings",
    "v062.tutorial.codes.text": "Choose the species code and the historical codebook. Review both competing meanings. A derived representation leaves conflicting codes literal and records Conflicting outcomes.",
    "v062.tutorial.date.title": "Retain ambiguous and impossible dates",
    "v062.tutorial.date.text": "Choose an explicit convention supported by evidence. A two-digit year does not establish a century, and an impossible date stays unresolved. Check every preview outcome.",
    "v062.tutorial.missing.title": "Keep zero distinct from missing",
    "v062.tutorial.missing.text": "Specify only the exact missing tokens documented by the protocol. Preview the derived field and verify that zero and non-detection records remain distinct.",
    "v062.tutorial.coordinate.title": "Review coordinate representation and datum",
    "v062.tutorial.coordinate.text": "Convert degrees, minutes and seconds only after reviewing the axis and explicitly recording a supported datum. This conversion does not reproject coordinates or discover an unknown CRS.",
    "v062.tutorial.notes.title": "Keep private questions and resume points",
    "v062.tutorial.notes.text": "Add a private working note and save a workspace bookmark. Edit the note, remove it, and recover it. These annotations stay outside scientific preservation exports.",
    "v062.tutorial.templates.title": "Build a reusable context template carefully",
